      "text_raw": "However, all other nodes create non-dominant poles. Since we find three other nodes 1, 2 and\n5, do we have three non-dominant poles?",
      "text": "However, all other nodes create non-dominant poles. Since we find three other nodes 1, 2 and 5, do we have three non-dominant poles?"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 212,
